{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/bf17c143330e01c4071c81dc47216efc.poster.avif?t=1766887201\" aria-label=\"Lilac, the games second character, aims her laser revolver into two mirrors and kills an enemy\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/bf17c143330e01c4071c81dc47216efc.webm?t=1766887201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/bf17c143330e01c4071c81dc47216efc.mp4?t=1766887201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ardor is a fast and lethal turn-based tactical card game. Play cards to dodge danger and kill enemies. Combat is simple but deep, with a high skill ceiling. Win fights to upgrade your deck and take on stronger foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Elegant Combat</strong></i>: Choose your cards carefully. Consider enemy attacks and decide how to dodge them while landing kills. Death is never far, but a forgiving turn reset allows you to redo mistakes and craft a perfect series of moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/b5c1f2fb7a72855a9072178102909101.poster.avif?t=1766887201\" aria-label=\"The player fights a centipede made of fingers\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/b5c1f2fb7a72855a9072178102909101.webm?t=1766887201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/b5c1f2fb7a72855a9072178102909101.mp4?t=1766887201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Flexible Upgrades:</strong></i> Upgrade <i>any</i> number on <i>any</i> card. Forge your deck and make it your own, by shaping your cards to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/6cb13726f9a1cff543a6b15b3fe9d364.poster.avif?t=1766887201\" aria-label=\"The player upgrades their cards, first increasing Laser&#039;s damage by two then Mirror&#039;s health by 1\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/6cb13726f9a1cff543a6b15b3fe9d364.webm?t=1766887201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/6cb13726f9a1cff543a6b15b3fe9d364.mp4?t=1766887201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Lethal Style:</strong></i> Ardor focuses on simple numbers, responsive controls, and sharp action. A tactics game for people who think tactics games are boring. No hit chances, no unskippable animations, no long tutorials. Clean and intuitive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/d0ce4676288e71c6e57847c968e05455.poster.avif?t=1766887201\" aria-label=\"The player browses their cards, then chooses a Dash and plays it\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/d0ce4676288e71c6e57847c968e05455.webm?t=1766887201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/d0ce4676288e71c6e57847c968e05455.mp4?t=1766887201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Three Characters:</strong></i>\u00a0Each character has their own deck and their own campaign. Kill bosses to unlock the next character, and prestige their deck fighting through whichever campaign you choose.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964890?t=1766887201","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/00a05bb934971bbfe2a93c90b5719f6bd8c77328/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766887201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/a78df3d84415a8829fa3a6929ad932933fb31f1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766887201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/a78df3d84415a8829fa3a6929ad932933fb31f1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766887201","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Ardor 2 contains stylized fantasy violence, viewed at a distance. Some enemies may be considered disturbing or gory, but everything is small scale on a tactics overview and the game does not immerse you in horrifying scenarios"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964890/extras/bf17c143330e01c4071c81dc47216efc.poster.avif?t=1766887201\" aria-label=\"